---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Blog"
description: "GEO and AI-visibility insights from Alyra: category education, vertical playbooks, technical execution, tools and original data."
lang: en
hreflang:
  - lang: fr
    url: "/fr/blog/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="blog-index-head">
  <span class="eyebrow">Blog</span>
  <h1>GEO and AI-visibility insights</h1>
  <p>Category education, vertical playbooks, technical execution, tools and original data — everything we publish on getting cited inside AI answers.</p>
  {% include "partials/translation-note.njk" %}
</div>

<div class="pillar-tabs" data-controls="blog-grid-en">
  <button type="button" class="pillar-tab active" data-pillar="all">All</button>
  {% for p in pillars %}
  <button type="button" class="pillar-tab" data-pillar="{{ p.key }}">{{ p.en }}</button>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="blog-index-body">
  <div class="blog-grid" id="blog-grid-en">
    {% for item in collections.blogEn %}
    <article class="blog-card" data-pillar="{{ item.data.pillar }}">
      <a href="{{ item.url }}">
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ item.data.category }}</span>
        <h3>{{ item.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="blog-card-meta">{{ item.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
      </a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="blog-empty">Nothing published in this category yet.</p>
</div>
